OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA man is rushed in to Majors
OL,7,     Fsuffering a collapsed lung as air
OL,8,     Fleaks into his chest cavity, a
OL,9,     Fhighly abusive patient must be
OL,10,     Frestrained, and a rough sleeper
OL,11,     Fcomes in with burnt feet.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FBack in Birmingham, Dr Emma and Dr
OL,14,     FDev face their biggest-ever head
OL,15,     Fcyst, Dr Adil preps a bride-to-be
OL,16,     Fby removing a large keloid, and Dr
OL,17,     FMagnus treats an unusual foot
OL,18,     Flipoma.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
