OL,5,G0155 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FWojcieches had an epileptic
OL,7,     Fseizure at work. And too little
OL,8,     Frecovery time between seizures
OL,9,     Fcould lead to permanent brain
OL,10,     Fdamage. Thomas has a ring stuck on
OL,11,     Fhis finger.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FCan Dr Emma remove some cysts from
OL,14,     Fpatient Georgia's leg without them
OL,15,     Fexploding? Dr Adil Sheraz tackles
OL,16,     Flipomas and there's an
OL,17,     Feye-watering mole for Dr Dev Shah.
OL,18,G0330 Friends
OL,19,G0400 Teleshopping
